          "type": "text",
          "text": "A 9 cm by 7 cm rectangle is joined to a 6 cm by 5 cm rectangle along the smaller rectangle's 5 cm edge. Find the outside perimeter of the shape in centimetres. Enter the numerical value only."
        }
      ],
      "marks": 3,
      "primary_outcome": "5.2",
      "secondary_outcomes": [],
      "response": {
